        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-ULTIMA-PC\"><b>Laurey Ultima Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Nickel Ultima Cabinet Pull is available in 4 sizes. The Satin Nickel finish is durable, making it ideal for high traffic cabinets such as those in the kitchen or in the bathroom. Each  of the Ultima Satin Nickel Cabinet Pulls come packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Ultima Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-41528:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41628:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41728:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-41828:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\" (192mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
